# Pin line endings for the Bowaka v2 lab.
#
# Generated / parity YAML (the frozen contract, the import-actual-config
# output) must be byte-stable across OSes so `import-actual-config` round-trips
# byte-identically and config-parity diffs are reproducible. Without this, a
# Windows checkout rewrites LF -> CRLF and the round-trip test fails.
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Shell scripts are executed inside the ql-jupyter Linux container; CRLF line
# endings break the shebang / `set -u` parsing there. Keep them LF on all OSes.
*.sh   text eol=lf
